# ============================================================================
# NEON DATABASE CONNECTION - Shared Incentive Intelligence System
# ============================================================================
# 
# This project connects to a shared Neon PostgreSQL database used by
# multiple services in the distributed incentive intelligence system.
#
# SETUP:
# 1. Create a Neon project at https://neon.tech
# 2. Create a branch (e.g., "main" or "dev")
# 3. Copy the connection string and paste below (keep pooling enabled)
# 4. Ensure the URL includes ?sslmode=require for secure connections
#
# FORMAT:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://[user]:[password]@[host]/[database]?sslmode=require"
#
# NEON EXAMPLE:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://neondb_owner:password@ep-xyz-123.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech:5432/neondb?sslmode=require"
#
# CONNECTION POOLING:
# - Use the pooler endpoint (recommended for Vercel/serverless)
# - Regular endpoint works for local development
#
# ============================================================================
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host:port/database?sslmode=require"
